em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>&lt;</mo></mrow></mstyle></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>8</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Since two negative numbers multiply to give a positive number, we first cancel the negatives:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"33\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 8.621em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mrow space=\"3\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28 TEX-S2\"></mjx-